          "quote": "The characterization revealed the significance of pre-cipitation of secondary phases M23C6, Ti (C, N), and γ0 phase in dictating the HCF strength of the alloy. Cyclic loading at high temperature causes γ-matrix hardening and secondary phase precipitation synergistically strengthening the material beyond its yield strength.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "d22778640f694bc0:part:001"
        },
